  "notes": "Master sync and timing: 6 black outputs (black burst, tri-level, 10 MHz or 1 PPS), genlock in with passive loop, word clock and DARS (AES/EBU) BNCs, 4 LTC outs (or 3 out and 1 in) on a 15-pin D-sub (XLR breakout SPG9000-XLR), GPI, GNSS receiver (SMA antenna input, option GNSS), 2 PTP ports on SFP+ (1/10G, ST 2059 / AES67, option PTP), 2 IP test signal ports on SFP28 (10/25G, ST 2110 with 2022-7, option IP), 4 SD to 12G-SDI test signal outputs on HD-BNC (option SDI), RJ45 management and NTP. Front: display, keypad, USB. Hot-swap power supplies: one (SPG9000-SPW) or two (SPG9000-DPW), IEC C14, 100-240V AC, 130 VA typical and 180 VA max. 482.6 x 44 x 516 mm, 4.85 kg; rack kit SPG9000-RACK. Sold by Ross Video as the SPG-9000 (https://www.rossvideo.com/products/signal-processing/spg-9000/). Pairs with the ECO8000 changeover.",
