  "notes": "Automatic changeover between a primary and a backup SPG9000 (or SPG8000A). 9 BNC channels, each with primary in, backup in and output: channels 1-6 are 50 MHz electronic fast-switch channels for black burst, tri-level, AES/DARS and word clock; channels 7-9 are 3 GHz relay channels that also pass SD/HD/3G-SDI. 4 LTC channels on DE-15 connectors (primary and backup LTC/SPG in, LTC out; XLR breakout ECO8000 XLR), GPI, RJ45 management (web UI, SNMP). Front: LCD, auto/manual and source buttons, per-channel fault LEDs, and two hot-swap power supplies that pull out from the front; IEC C14 inlets at the back, 100-240V AC, 50 VA max. 483 x 43.7 x 557 mm, 4.5 kg; rack slides ECO8000 RACK, 12 inch cable set ECO8000 CBL. Sold by Ross Video as the ECO-8000 (https://www.rossvideo.com/products/signal-processing/eco-8000/), whose page lists a 3-channel base unit with REF, HREF and LTC options; Telestream's current sheet lists all 9 channels and 4 LTC as standard.",
